      <!-- Lead paragraph -->
      <div class="lead">
        <p>Pharmaceutical and healthcare manufacturing is a highly regulated, capital-intensive industrial activity governed by strict public health laws, rigorous engineering controls, and absolute quality standards. Unlike consumer manufacturing sectors, this industry operates under continuous statutory oversight, where every single batch production, utility configuration, and packaging line is subject to strict regulatory validation. For entrepreneurs and investors, navigating this compliance-first landscape requires a systematic, scientific approach to facility design, technology selection, and quality systems.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Table of Contents (SEO Checklist compliant) -->
